        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_c61c0a72">
            <ab><hi rendition="#larger">
                <hi rendition="#i">
                    <lb />Now Possible ~
                    <hi rendition="#c">
                        <lb />Through the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon (Licensee)</name>
                    </hi>
                    <hi rendition="#right">
                        <lb />Library of Music
                    </hi>
                </hi>
            </hi></ab>
        </div>

        <div>
            <div facs="#eSc_textblock_1ee7c53a">
                <ab><lb />The masterpieces of the world's most
                <lb />famous pianists are presented through the
                <lb />extensive <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon (Licensee) Library</name>
                <lb />of Music.
                <lb />
                <seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#personality" type="topic" resp="#np">
                    All the verve,
                    all the delicate tone shading, all
                    <lb />the personality that makes of the artist a true
                </seg></ab>
            </div>
            <div facs="#eSc_textblock_a311a566">
                <ab><lb />artists have been retained and
                <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#exact_reproduction" type="topic" resp="#np">
                    reproduced ex-
                    <lb />actly
                    <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#virtual_presence" type="topic" resp="#np">
                        as though the master himself were seated
                        <lb />at the keyboard.
                    </seg>
                </seg>
                <lb />This is possible, and only is it
                possible, through<lb />the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon (Licensee)</name>
                <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#analogy_to_photography" resp="#np" type="topic">
                    photographic<lb />process of
                    recording.
                </seg></ab>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div>
            <div facs="#eSc_textblock_65dcf1c2">
                <ab><lb />A few more of over 200
                <lb />Artists who record for
                <lb /><name type="brand">Welte-Mignon (Licensee)</name>:</ab>
            </div>
            <div facs="#eSc_textblock_59f05978">
                <ab><lb /><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118694820">Gieseking</persName>
                <lb /><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/119362112">Casella</persName>
