        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_a1d08d9a">
            <ab><lb />The <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon (Licensee)</name> reproducing action may now be obtained in 115 leading
            <lb />makes of pianos. You can have this famous action installed in your own piano without
            <lb />messing the appearance or hindering manual playing.</ab>
